  observedCondition: The body was documented in its original position before nearby
    items were moved. Cause and manner were not inferred from position alone.
  investigativeContext: Position, visible injuries and nearby physical evidence may
    help reconstruct events when considered together. The body is examined and logged
    in place rather than collected as a portable item.
  loggingContext: 
